  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Electrificacion Rural II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Electrification Program II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to increase access to electricity in rural areas of the Plurinational State of Bolivia,
making public and social services available to the population and helping to reduce poverty levels. The specific objectives are to increase:
(i) electricity coverage in rural areas; (ii) the consumption of electricity for production-related uses in rural areas, with a gender focus; and
(iii) electricity transmission capacity, in order to meet demand in the area where coverage will be expanded under the program and reduce
CO2 emissions associated with the use of fossil fuels in isolated systems</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">el objetivo general es incrementar el acceso a la energa elctrica en
el rea rural del Estado Plurinacional de Bolivia, facilitando la integracin de la poblacin a servicios pblicos
y sociales, contribuyendo a la reduccin de los niveles de pobreza. Los objetivos especficos son
incrementar: (i) la cobertura del servicio elctrico en el rea rural; (ii) el consumo de energa elctrica en
usos productivos en el rea rural, con un enfoque de gnero; y (iii) la capacidad de transmisin de energa
elctrica para poder atender la demanda en la zona de ampliacin de cobertura bajo el programa, y reducir
las emisiones de CO2 asociadas al uso de combustibles fsiles en sistemas aislados.</narrative>
  </description>
